      "id": 19439,
      "name": "Fimbria",
      "username": "Fimbria",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/dc4da7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-09-28T13:41:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>A question came up during gameplay. The character bios imply a few interesting (and fairly minor) card interactions, but the cards don't directly say whether these should work, and Googling the forums isn't turning up answers.</p>\n<p>The Maerinyan Refuge has cards which heal and protect Maerinyans. Is Tempest a Maerinyan?</p>\n<p>Grand Warlord Voss has a card which reduces damage to Thorathians. Is Sky-Scraper a Thorathian?</p>\n<p>Luminary has cards which heal devices (including those not his own), increase damage of devices, and respond to damage dealt to devices. Omnitron-IV has cards which damage non-devices. Is Omnitron-X/U a device?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:53:07.673Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 10,
      "reads": 1,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 50.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 19439,
      "topic_slug": "question-tempest-in-the-refuge",
      "display_username": "Fimbria",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
