      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>A question came up during gameplay. The character bios imply a few interesting (and fairly minor) card interactions, but the cards don't directly say whether these should work, and Googling the forums isn't turning up answers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Maerinyan Refuge has cards which heal and protect Maerinyans. Is Tempest a Maerinyan?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Grand Warlord Voss has a card which reduces damage to Thorathians. Is Sky-Scraper a Thorathian?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Luminary has cards which heal devices (including those not his own), increase damage of devices, and respond to damage dealt to devices. Omnitron-IV has cards which damage non-devices. Is Omnitron-X/U a device?</p>",
